{"3820320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoveil : The Last Guest", "steam_appid": 3820320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Every guest who checked in… was never seen again.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > stumble across a half-abandoned motel deep in the woods. It looks lived-in. Warm lights glow in the hallways. There’s luggage left behind. But no one answers the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Echoveil: The Last Guest</strong>, you play as a lone Journalist seeking shelter —only to uncover a chilling secret hiding behind every door. The motel seems to breathe. Rooms shift. Shadows move where they shouldn’t. And something… or someone… is watching you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 Explore. Listen. Escape.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ <strong>Explore the motel</strong> and uncover its past through forgotten journals, eerie sounds, and the belongings of guests who vanished.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪞 <strong>Experience psychological horror</strong> without cheap jumpscares—only subtle tension, shifting spaces, and things that shouldn’t exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠<strong> Find clues</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Designed for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>narrative horror</strong> and <strong>walking sims</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>atmospheric, emotional mysteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short-form story experiences (20–30 minutes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the motel... or become its last guest?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Every guest who checked in… was never seen again.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > stumble across a half-abandoned motel deep in the woods. It looks lived-in. Warm 